2 CONT Marquis Cheng of Jin (Chinese: 晉成侯; pinyin: Jìn Chéng Hóu), personal name Ji Furen, was a marquis of the Jin state. He succeeded his father, Marquis Wu, and was in turn succeeded by his son, Marquis Li.
