2 CONC d Historian (in Chinese). Guoxue.com. Retrieved 14 May 2012. 4.^ Han Zhaoqi (韩兆琦), ed. (2010). Shiji (史记) (in Chinese). Beijing: Zhonghua Book Company. p. 2510–2512. ISBN 978-7-101-07272-3. 5.^ China: From Neolithic cultures throu
