1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kung 贏 (Ying) was a nobleman from ancient China, estimated to have lived between 665 BCE and 609 BCE. He was the son of Renhao (任好), Duke Mu of Qin (秦穆公) and Ji, and the father of Kung 贏. His lineage was part of th
